window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-6f81d9f9c0bb24f9"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"native-development\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">原生应用开发</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>构建和调试 iOS 与 macOS 应用。</p> <p>在 Apple 平台项目中使用 Codex 时，最好为每一轮工作都安排构建、运行或模拟器验证。构建新的或现有的 iOS 与 macOS 应用、反复改进界面和调试问题时，可以参考以下用例。</p> <p><a id=\"build-the-app-shell\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">搭建应用骨架</h2> <p>让 Codex 按照可重复的构建流程搭建 iOS 和 macOS 应用。macOS 应用骨架用例会进一步介绍侧栏—详情—检查器布局、命令、设置和其他桌面原生结构。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/native-ios-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">面向 iOS 开发（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 搭建 iOS SwiftUI 项目，并优先采用 CLI 构建流程，例如 <code>xcodebuild</code>……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/native-macos-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">面向 macOS 开发（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 构建 macOS SwiftUI 应用，配置以 Shell 命令为主的构建和运行流程，并添加……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/macos-sidebar-detail-inspector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">搭建 Mac 应用骨架（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 和 Build macOS Apps 插件，把应用想法转化为具有原生桌面体验的……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"refactor-ios-swiftui-screens\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"ios-swiftui\">重构 iOS SwiftUI 界面</h2> <p>在不改变现有行为的前提下拆分大型 SwiftUI 视图；等应用准备好后，再把选定的 iOS 流程迁移到 Liquid Glass。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-swiftui-view-refactor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">重构 SwiftUI 界面（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 和 Build iOS Apps 插件，将冗长的 SwiftUI 视图拆分为专用的……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-liquid-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">采用 Liquid Glass（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 和 Build iOS Apps 插件检查现有 iPhone 和 iPad 界面，并用 iOS 26 API 替换自定义……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"expose-ios-actions-to-the-system\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"ios\">向系统开放 iOS 操作</h2> <p>让 Codex 找出应用应该开放哪些操作和实体，使用户能从系统界面调用应用功能。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-app-intents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">添加 iOS App Intents（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 和 Build iOS Apps 插件，确定应用应该向系统界面开放哪些操作和实体……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"debug-your-app\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">调试应用</h2> <p>让 Codex 在模拟器中复现问题，或为 macOS 应用添加遥测信息，帮助你排查并修复问题。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-simulator-bug-debugging\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 iOS 模拟器中调试（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 Codex 找到合适的 Xcode 方案和模拟器、启动应用、检查界面……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/macos-telemetry-logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">添加 Mac 遥测日志（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 在 macOS 功能周围添加少量高价值的 <code>Logger</code> 事件……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"native-development\">Native development</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Build and debug iOS and macOS apps.</p> <p>Codex works great on Apple platform projects when each pass has a build, run, or simulator loop attached to it. These use cases are helpful when you are building new or existing iOS and macOS apps and need to iterate on the UI and debug issues.</p> <h2 id=\"build-the-app-shell\">Build the app shell</h2> <p>Ask Codex to scaffold iOS and macOS apps with repeatable build loops. The Mac shell use case goes deeper on sidebar-detail-inspector layouts, commands, settings, and other desktop-native structure.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/native-ios-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build for iOS (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex to scaffold iOS SwiftUI projects, keep the build loop CLI-first with <code>xcodebuild</code>...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/native-macos-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build for macOS (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex to build macOS SwiftUI apps, wire a shell-first build-and-run loop, and add...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/macos-sidebar-detail-inspector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build a Mac app shell (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex and the Build macOS Apps plugin to turn an app idea into a desktop-native...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"refactor-ios-swiftui-screens\">Refactor iOS SwiftUI screens</h2> <p>Use Codex to split large SwiftUI views without changing behavior, then move selected iOS flows to Liquid Glass when the app is ready.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-swiftui-view-refactor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refactor SwiftUI screens (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex and the Build iOS Apps plugin to break a long SwiftUI view into dedicated section...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-liquid-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Adopt liquid glass (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex and the Build iOS Apps plugin to audit existing iPhone and iPad UI, replace custom...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"expose-ios-actions-to-the-system\">Expose iOS actions to the system</h2> <p>Leverage Codex to identify the actions and entities your app should expose through App Intents, so users can reach app behavior from system surfaces.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-app-intents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add iOS app intents (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex and the Build iOS Apps plugin to identify the actions and entities your app should...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"debug-your-app\">Debug your app</h2> <p>Have Codex reproduce bugs in Simulator or add telemetry to your macOS app to help you debug and fix issues.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/ios-simulator-bug-debugging\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Debug in iOS simulator (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex to discover the right Xcode scheme and simulator, launch the app, inspect the UI...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/macos-telemetry-logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Mac telemetry (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex and the Build macOS Apps plugin to add a few high-signal <code>Logger</code> events around...</li> </ul>"};
